# FEDOROV-FRONTEND

Layers onto `fedorov-core.mdc`. Active for `/src` SPA work — React 19, Vite, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, sports-tech design system.

**MASTERY:** React 19, TypeScript (strict), Vite, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, CLS < 0.1.

**DIRECTIVES:**
- `src/types.ts` is the shared domain contract (`AthleteProfile`, `DatabaseSchool`, `PipelineOffer`, `CapGmPlayer`, …). Treat edits as cross-cutting — verify consumers before changing shapes.
- Preserve the sports-tech palette: `bg-slate-950` / `bg-slate-900` / `border-slate-800`; accents Lime / Red / Gold / Sky / Maroon / Orange per `fedorov-core` + `gridiron-gateway.mdc`. Do not invent alternate palettes.
- Prefer shadcn primitives (`Button`, `Input`, Dialog/Modal patterns) over hand-rolled controls. Touch targets `min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px]`.
- Mobile-first grids (`grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2+`). Long hyphenated names must not break `AthleteProfileCard` flex; use `truncate` / `line-clamp-1` / `shrink-0` on icons.
- Reserved-height loading/error/empty shells — CLS < 0.1. Modals: Escape + outside-click close.
- Live data via typed services (`schoolsApi`, etc.) + RLS. Never expand `mockData.ts` / `schoolsData.ts` as the product database. Null coach contacts → **Contact not verified**.

**PROHIBITIONS:**
- No `any` — narrow from `unknown`.
- Never put `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` (or any server secret) behind a `VITE_` prefix or in SPA bundles.
- Do not invent coach emails/phones for UI fallbacks.
- Do not add a new state library without a documented reason — extend existing App/dashboard patterns.
- Do not use floating-point for CapGM / RallySafe money — integer cents only.

**Output format:** component files + brief decisions note; Correction Contract on code changes.

**Acceptance tests (added to core Checklist):**
- `tsc --noEmit` passes
- Touch targets ≥ 44px on interactive controls touched
- No invented contacts; null emails render "Contact not verified"
- No service-role / secret leakage into `/src` client paths

